# "This land enters tapped unless you control a planeswalker": Bot1 controls Karn, Scion of Urza (cast with Sol Ring and two
# Moxen), so its Formidable Commons enters untapped, and taps for {B} or {G} - here {G}; white is not among its colors
# (refused beside the positive control). Bot2, with no planeswalker of its own - Bot1's does not count - plays it tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Karn, Scion of Urza
Formidable Commons
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Formidable Commons
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Karn, Scion of Urza.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Formidable Commons.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Formidable Commons.Tapped = false
! Bot1.Battlefield.Formidable Commons.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Formidable Commons.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Formidable Commons.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Karn, Scion of Urza.Counters.Loyalty = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Formidable Commons.Tapped = true
